flowchart TB
accTitle: Remove repeated reads from primary database compute
accDescr: Eligible reads use a cache and read replica path. Writes and freshness-sensitive reads use the primary, while asynchronous replication feeds the replica.
A[Application data access]:::inputData -->|Reusable read| C{Valid cache entry?}:::decision
C -->|Hit| O[Return cached result]:::output
C -->|Miss| R[(MySQL read replica)]:::storage
R --> F[Return result and fill cache]:::output
A -->|Write or current read| P[(Primary MySQL instance)]:::storage
P -.->|Asynchronous replication| R
